HST Office: Switch Row/Column and Reset to Match Style on the chart tabs of the ribbon.

The chart tabs of Writer, Sheets and Slides get "Dữ liệu theo hàng" / "Dữ liệu theo cột" (Chart Design ▸ Data) and
"Đặt lại điểm dữ liệu" / "Đặt lại mọi điểm dữ liệu" (Chart Format ▸ Current Selection), as on the Office chart
tabs. The chart command interceptor forwards them to the chart's frame like the other chart commands, and their
labels are added to the generic commands so the ribbon of the document finds them.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
